  "type": "html-template",
  "original": {
    "html": "<section\n  style=\"max-width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; font-family: 'Noto Sans SC', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; letter-spacing: 0.02em;\">\n\n  <section\n    style=\"height: 30vh; border-bottom-left-radius: 30px; border-bottom-right-radius: 30px; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.12); overflow: hidden;\">\n    <section style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100%;\">\n      <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/400/500?random=1\" alt=\"背景图片\"\n        style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block;\">\n      <section style=\"margin-top: -380px; padding: 25px;\">\n        <h1\n          style=\"font-size: 2.0rem; font-weight: 900; color: white; margin: 0 0 5px 0; letter-spacing: -0.02em; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); animation: fadeIn 1.5s ease-out;\">\n          无腿母亲的翅膀</h1>\n        <h2\n          style=\"font-size: 1.0rem; font-weight: 500; color: #ffffff; margin: 0; opacity: 0.9; text-shadow: 1px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\">\n          用空荡裤管丈量出的星辰大海</h2>\n        <section style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 10px;\">\n          <section\n            style=\"background: #e74c3c; color: white; padding: 8px 15px; border-radius: 30px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.3);\">\n            Bilibili</section>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <section\n    style=\"padding: 20px; background-color: white; margin: 10px 0;; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    <h2\n      style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: #333; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px; padding-left: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #e74c3c;\">\n      月光下的生命轨迹</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 15px 0; text-align: justify; color: #444;\">\n      月光在嶙峋的山脊上流淌，<span\n        style=\"font-weight: 600;\">47岁的张秀兰</span>用铁支架撑起空荡的裤管，双手攥着麻绳在陡坡上缓慢移动。轮椅车筐里塞满泛黄的作业本，后视镜里映出女儿小芳回头时的泪光。母亲布满老茧的手指渗出血迹，在青石板上拖出蜿蜒的红线——那是大山里最倔强的生命轨迹。\n    </p>\n\n    <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"60\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 60\" style=\"margin: 0 0;\">\n      <path d=\"M 0 30 C 100 10, 300 50, 400 30\" stroke=\"#e74c3c\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,4\"\n        stroke-dashoffset=\"0\">\n        <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"0\" to=\"-8\" dur=\"0.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n      </path>\n    </svg>\n  </section>\n\n  <section\n    style=\"padding: 20px 10px; background-color: #f9f9f9; margin: 10px 0;; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    <h2\n      style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: #333; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px; padding-left: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #3498db;\">\n      竹椅上的生存史诗</h2>\n\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #3498db; margin: 25px 0 15px 0;\">母亲的\"行走哲学\"</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 20px 0; text-align: justify; color: #444;\">\n      1998年矿难夺走她的双腿，却没带走她丈量世界的渴望。</p>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; margin: 15px 0; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);\">\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n        <section style=\"width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3498db; margin-right: 10px;\">\n        </section>\n        <h4 style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; color: #333;\">运输革命</h4>\n      </section>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; text-align: justify; color: #555; padding-left: 18px;\">\n        改造三轮车加装木板，用身体当支点推行2公里山路，每日往返消耗相当于正常人徒步10公里的体力。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; margin: 15px 0; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);\">\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n        <section style=\"width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3498db; margin-right: 10px;\">\n        </section>\n        <h4 style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; color: #333;\">经济自立</h4>\n      </section>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; text-align: justify; color: #555; padding-left: 18px;\">\n        编织竹器日收入20元，鸡舍养活全家的\"铁算盘\"账本上密密麻麻记录着：\"3月15日，卖鸡蛋12枚得8元，够小芳一个月午餐费\"。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; margin: 15px 0; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);\">\n      <section style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n        <section style=\"width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3498db; margin-right: 10px;\">\n        </section>\n        <h4 style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; color: #333;\">精神重建</h4>\n      </section>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; text-align: justify; color: #555; padding-left: 18px;\">\n        \"腿断了，心要往高处长\"——用粉笔在院墙上抄写《飞向天空的马》课文，每晚用手电筒为儿女照亮作业。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #3498db; margin: 25px 0 15px 0;\">子女的认知牢笼</h3>\n    <p\n      style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 15px 0; text-align: justify; color: #444; font-style: italic;\">\n      \"山外是白纸，妈妈画了二十年圆圈\"</p>\n    <ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; margin: 15px 0;\">\n      <li style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: justify; color: #555;\">\n        村小教室漏雨的屋顶下，同龄人讨论着\"矿工月薪三千\"，小芳却偷偷撕碎招工传单：\"我要考到有电梯的城市\"</li>\n      <li style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: justify; color: #555;\">\n        老支书泼冷水：\"供俩大学生，不如卖苞谷换棺材！\"时，母亲正用假肢残端夹着竹篾，将碎布头编织成书包</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <section\n    style=\"padding: 20px 10px; background-color: white; margin: 10px 0;; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    <h2\n      style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: #333; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px; padding-left: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #e67e22;\">\n      当现实撞碎梦想</h2>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"background: #fff8f3; padding: 25px; border-radius: 15px; margin: 20px 0; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(230, 126, 34, 0.1);\">\n      <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #e67e22; margin: 0 0 15px 0;\">学费事件：裤管里的血色宣言</h3>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 15px 0; text-align: justify; color: #444;\">\n        2015年县中录取通知书到来那夜，小芳摔碎了腌菜坛子：\"打工三个月就够学杂费！\"</p>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; margin: 15px 0; text-align: justify; color: #444;\">\n        母亲突然掀开裤管，两团棉絮裹着的矿伤在月光下渗血：<span style=\"font-weight: 600; color: #e67e22;\">\"把腿接上，我要爬着去县城！\"</span></p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"background: #fff8f3; padding: 25px; border-radius: 15px; margin: 20px 0; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(230, 126, 34, 0.1);\">\n      <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #e67e22; margin: 0 0 15px 0;\">村庄的集体审判</h3>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0; text-align: justify; color: #444;\">\n        邻居王婶扔来腌菜：\"瘸子供书呆子能当饭吃？\"时，母亲正用膝盖跪着修补女儿的校服——这个动作已导致她膝盖皮肤溃烂。</p>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <section\n    style=\"padding: 20px 10px; background-color: #f9f9f9; margin: 10px 0;; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    <h2\n      style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: #333; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px; padding-left: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #27ae60;\">\n      光从裂缝中照进来</h2>\n\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #27ae60; margin: 20px 0 15px 0;\">\"天使校长\"的承诺</h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 15px 0; text-align: justify; color: #444;\">\n      李校长免除全部学费，安排小芳在图书馆整理书籍：<span style=\"font-weight: 500; font-style: italic;\">\"你妈妈用血写的路，我们接续写成诗\"</span></p>\n    <section style=\"padding-left: 20px; border-left: 3px solid #eaeaea; margin: 15px 0;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; text-align: justify; color: #555;\">\n        深夜值班时，校长悄悄塞给她助学金：\"这是你妈妈的'腿'基金\"——实为将母亲事迹改编成教材后的稿费</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #27ae60; margin: 25px 0 15px 0;\">公益组织的精密齿轮</h3>\n    <section\n      style=\"background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 15px 0; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);\">\n      <h4 style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #333;\">假肢捐赠现场的反转</h4>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 10px 0; text-align: justify; color: #555;\">\n        医生摇头：\"残肢萎缩无法安装。\"</p>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; text-align: justify; color: #555;\">母亲却露出笑容：<span\n          style=\"font-weight: 600; color: #27ae60;\">\"能走3公里送娃上学就行！\"</span></p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 15px 0; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);\">\n      <h4 style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #333;\">数字桥梁的奇迹</h4>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; text-align: justify; color: #555;\">女儿在作文比赛获奖：<span\n          style=\"font-style: italic;\">\"母亲用竹篾编织的翅膀，终于托起我们飞向云端\"</span>——其获奖作文《我的腿是竹编的》引发全网关注</p>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"margin: 10px 0px; border-radius: 15px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    <section style=\"height: 180px; border-radius: 30px;overflow: hidden;\">\n      <section style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100%;\">\n        <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/800/400?random=2\" alt=\"背景图片\"\n          style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block;\">\n        <section style=\"margin-top: -88px; padding: 30px 25px 20px;\">\n          <h2\n            style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; color: white; text-shadow: 1px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\">\n            永不熄灭的星光</h2>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <section style=\"padding:40px 25px 10px; background: white;margin-top:-30px\">\n      <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #9b59b6; margin: 10px 0 20px 0;\">跨越时空的学习场景</h3>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 15px 0; text-align: justify; color: #444;\">\n        2020年冬夜，二手电脑屏幕在漏风的屋檐下闪烁：</p>\n      <ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; margin: 15px 0;\">\n        <li style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: justify; color: #555;\">\n          儿子视频里展示地质勘探图：\"这条隧道要打通母亲的路\"，背后是正在建设的\"秀兰助学路\"工程</li>\n        <li style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify; color: #555;\">\n          母亲在烟盒背面写\"努力\"，窗外传来火车汽笛——这是她第一次听到火车声</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #9b59b6; margin: 30px 0 20px 0;\">代际命运的交响</h3>\n      <section style=\"display: flex; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n        <section style=\"min-width: 6px; background: #9b59b6; border-radius: 3px; margin-right: 15px;\"></section>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; text-align: justify; color: #555;\">\n          儿子成为返乡工程师：\"要让山里人腿比路长\"，其设计的索道将山货运输成本降低70%</p>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"display: flex; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n        <section style=\"min-width: 6px; background: #9b59b6; border-radius: 3px; margin-right: 15px;\"></section>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; text-align: justify; color: #555;\">\n          女儿在基金会工作：\"为千万个母亲，造不垮的桥\"，正在筹建\"无腿母亲助学专项基金\"</p>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <section\n    style=\"padding: 20px 10px; margin: 10px 0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ece9e6 0%, #ffffff 100%); border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: #333; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 25px;\">大山的回声</h2>\n\n    <section style=\"width: 100%; height: 200px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;\">\n      <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/800/400?random=3\" alt=\"山间景色\"\n        style=\"width: 100% !important; height: 100% !important; object-fit: cover; display: block; border-radius: 12px; max-width: none !important; max-height: none !important; vertical-align: top;\">\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; margin: 15px 0; text-align: justify; color: #444;\">\n      十五年后，母亲扶着新装的碳纤维义肢，站在以她命名的\"秀兰大桥\"观景台。孙女蹦跳着奔向校车，山风掀起她褪色的衣角。远处列车呼啸着\"向北向北到北京\"，而她的目光追随着孙女的背影——那里有她用空荡裤管丈量出的，通向星辰的路。</p>\n\n    <section style=\"margin: 30px 0 10px; padding: 25px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); border-radius: 12px;\">\n      <section\n        style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; background: #e74c3c; color: white; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block;\">\n        CORE QUOTES</section>\n      <blockquote style=\"margin: 10px 0 0; padding: 0 0 0 20px; border-left: 3px solid #e74c3c;\">\n        <p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7; font-style: italic; color: #333; margin: 0 0 15px 0;\">\n          \"她的腿留在了25年前的矿洞，却把腰弯成彩虹桥\"</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7; font-style: italic; color: #333; margin: 0 0 15px 0;\">\n          \"大山教人跪地爬行，我们偏偏要带走苍穹\"</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7; font-style: italic; color: #333; margin: 0;\">\n          \"每个走出大山的脚印，都是母亲空荡裤管里开出的花\"</p>\n      </blockquote>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n</section>"
  },
  "html": "<section style=\"padding: 24px; color: #292b2e; background-color: #fff\"><h1 style=\"font-size: 2.0rem; font-weight: 900; color: white; margin: 0 0 5px 0; letter-spacing: -0.02em\">把生活里的小事，慢慢做好</h1><section><p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 15px 0; text-align: justify; color: #444\">生活里有许多值得记录的瞬间。早上推开窗，阳光落在桌面上，新的一天从一杯温水开始。</p><h2 style=\"font-size: 1.0rem; font-weight: 500; color: #ffffff; margin: 0\">留一点时间给自己</h2><p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 15px 0; text-align: justify; color: #444\">每天给自己留出一小段安静的时间，读几页书，或者去楼下走一走。<strong>从一件具体的小事开始</strong>，让改变自然发生。</p><blockquote style=\"margin: 10px 0 0; padding: 0 0 0 20px; border-left: 3px solid #e74c3c\"><p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 15px 0; text-align: justify; color: #444\">认真对待每一个平常的日子。</p></blockquote><h2 style=\"font-size: 1.0rem; font-weight: 500; color: #ffffff; margin: 0\">让行动变得简单</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; margin: 15px 0\"><li style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: justify; color: #555\">选一件今天可以完成的事</li><li style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: justify; color: #555\">留意自己的真实感受</li><li style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: justify; color: #555\">给下一次尝试留出余地</li></ul><table><thead><tr><th>时段</th><th>安排</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>早晨</td><td>散步和阅读</td></tr><tr><td>傍晚</td><td>回顾一天</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 15px 0; text-align: justify; color: #444\">生活不会因为一次决定立刻改变，但持续的行动会慢慢留下痕迹。</p></section></section>",
  "layoutPrompt": "[cw-imported-style:{\"root\":\"padding:24px;color:#292b2e;background-color:#fff\",\"elements\":{\"h1\":\"font-size: 2.0rem; font-weight: 900; color: white; margin: 0 0 5px 0; letter-spacing: -0.02em\",\"h2\":\"font-size: 1.0rem; font-weight: 500; color: #ffffff; margin: 0\",\"h3\":\"font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #3498db; margin: 25px 0 15px 0\",\"h4\":\"font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; color: #333\",\"p\":\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 15px 0; text-align: justify; color: #444\",\"ul\":\"padding-left: 20px; margin: 15px 0\",\"li\":\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: justify; color: #555\",\"blockquote\":\"margin: 10px 0 0; padding: 0 0 0 20px; border-left: 3px solid #e74c3c\",\"img\":\"width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block\",\"span\":\"font-weight: 600\"}}]",
